Target an enemy and summon a |cFFFFFFFFTentacle of N'Zoth|r on the ground near them that will silence them and deal ${$806596m2+$806596ppl2+$SP*.75} Shadow damage every $806596t2 sec for $806596d. If your target runs out of range, the tentacle will seek a new target.

The tentacle gains health based on your Stamina. If the tentacle dies, the silence effect will end.

@ext:You may only have 1 |cFFFFFFFFOld God Tentacle|r active at a time.:ext@

Casting |cffffffffEndbringer|r now marks the ground beneath you as your |cffffffffGravesite|r for $804722d.

Direct critical strikes made against enemies within a |cffffffffGravesite|r now deals ${$300979m1*$<scalingbp>+$AP*0.36} Shadow damage.

@ext:This effect is still active while in another Reaper's |cffffffffGravesite|r.:ext@

Bring mojo to an ally, healing for ${$m1+0+$SP*0.185} every $T1 sec for $d. 

While channeling, you can instantly cast |cFFFFFFFFPotion Toss|r, |cFFFFFFFFSplash Potion|r and |cFFFFFFFFSpirit in a Bottle|r at a $573288s1% increased cost.

@ext:This spell is unaffected by haste modifiers.:ext@

Strike an enemy with zeal, dealing ${$m1+0+$AP*0.285+$SP*0.75} Physical damage, triggering |cffffffffZealotry|r, and granting an |cffffffffOath|r.

